```text
MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

January 19, 2022
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #S-8-22 for a Contract between the City of Cheyenne and
Front Range Roofing Systems, LLC, for the Ice and Events Center Roof
Replacement project
______________________________________________

A Mandatory Pre-Bid Meeting was held for this project, and eleven (11) bidders were in attendance
for the meeting.

Four (4) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.

The Four (4) bids were received from:
1. Front Range Roofing Systems, LLC.  Greeley, CO
2. Douglass Colony Group.  Greeley, CO.
3. Alpine Roofing LTD.  Denver, CO.
4. Sunwest Roofing.  Colorado Springs, CO.
a. Sunwest did not utilize Addendum 4 Bid Sheet.

The bids were reviewed by Vicki Nemecek (Public Works), Steve Gaer (Public Works), and Britt
Morgan (Plan One Architects), and their recommendation is to accept the lowest responsive bid
from Front Range Roofing Systems, for a total bid award amount of $181,650.00 for the Base Bid
(Ice and Events Center Roof Replacement Project) + Additional Bid Item #1 (Stucco Repairs).

Funding:
001-21-2113-40-32107 (General Fund / Capital Improvement Expenses)

$172,685.05

001-14-1412-40-21601 (General Fund / Maintenance)

$8,964.95

Grand Total $181,650.00
```

